      "body": "## Motivation\n\nDeepSeek-V4 and DeepSeek-V3.2 still encode tool schemas when a Chat Completions request sets `tool_choice=\"none\"`. Output parsing is disabled for this choice, so a model-generated native tool call can leak into `message.content` as raw DSML.\n\nFixes #35736\n\n## Modifications\n\n- Remove request-level and message-level tools from the copied DSV4/DSV32 messages when tools are disabled.\n- Preserve the existing tool encoding behavior for `tool_choice=\"auto\"`.\n- Add regression coverage for DSV4 and DSV32, including system and developer message tools.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\nAdded prompt-encoding unit tests for `tool_choice=\"none\"` and `tool_choice=\"auto\"`. This change does not modify model execution.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nNot applicable. The change only removes tool fields from copied messages when tool use is disabled.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Format your code according to the [Format code with pre-commit](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#format-code-with-pre-commit).\n- [x] Add unit tests according to the [Run and add unit tests](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#run-and-add-unit-tests).\n- [x] Documentation is not required because the public API does not change.\n- [x] Accuracy and speed benchmarks are not applicable because model execution does not change.\n- [x] Follow the SGLang code style [guidance](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#code-style-guidance).\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #33529512470](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/33529512470)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #33529512078](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/33529512078)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 7.2): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd-rocm720:start -->:x: [Run #33529512394](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/33529512394)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd-rocm720:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
